hadiths[25]{hadithnumber,text}:
"957","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo jannat mein dakhil hoga woh hamesha ni'mat aur khushhali mein rahega; woh kabhi badbakht nahin hoga, us ke kapde kabhi purane nahin honge, na us ki jawani kabhi khatm hogi; aur jannat mein woh hai jo na kisi aankh ne dekha, na kisi kaan ne suna, aur na kisi insani dil ne kabhi tasawwur kiya.'"
"958","[AI-translation] Qatadah (Rahimahullah) se Allah Ta'ala ke qaul: 'lambi chhaon' ke bare mein riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jannat mein ek darakht hai jis ke sae mein sawar sau saal safar karega, lekin woh us ke aakhir tak nahin pahunch sakega.' Mu'ammar ne kaha: Muhammad bin Ziyad ne mujhe bataya ke unhon ne Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ko Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se wohi bayan karte suna. Phir Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Agar tum chaho to Allah Ta'ala ka qaul padho: 'Aur phaili hui chhaon.'"
"959","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jannat mein ek darakht hai jis ke sae mein sawar sau saal safar karega.'"
"960","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jahannam wale jahannam mein dale jayenge, aur woh kahegi: Kya kuch aur hai? Yahan tak ke Allah, Tabarak wa Ta'ala, us ke paas aayega aur us mein Apna qadam rakhega, phir woh simat jayegi aur kahegi: Bas, bas.'"
"961","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Meri ummat mein se jannat mein dakhil hone wali pahli jama'at chaudhwin raat ke chaand ki surat mein hogi, phir jo un ke baad dakhil honge woh aasman ke sab se roshan sitare ki surat mein honge. Woh na peshab karenge na thukenge na naak saaf karenge. Un ki kanghiyan sone ki hongi aur un ka paseena mushk hoga. Un ki angeethiyan ood ki hongi. Un ki biwiyan hooren hongi, aur un ki takhleeq ek surat mein hogi, jaise un ke walid Adam (Alaihissalam), saath hath lambe.'"
"962","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab banda jahannam se saat martaba panah mangta hai to woh kahti hai: Aey Rabb! Tere falan bande ne mujh se panah mangi hai, to use panah de. Aur jo Allah se saat martaba jannat mangta hai to jannat kahti hai: Aey Rabb! Tere falan bande ne mere bare mein manga hai, to use (mujh mein) dakhil farma.'"
"963","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Zameen par jannat ki cheezon mein se sirf yeh pathar (Hajr Aswad) aur Ajwah khajoor ki kasht baqi rahi hain; jannat ke bartan roz teen martaba Furat ke pani mein duboe jate hain. Ek aadmi ne poocha: Kya tum ne yeh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna hai? Unhon ne jawab diya: Phir mujhe kya parwah agar main ne use Aap se nahin suna? Us ne dobara poocha, aur unhon ne jawab diya: Phir mujhe kya parwah agar main ne use Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se nahin suna?"
"964","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Woh aag jo log jalate hain jahannam ki aag ke sattar hisson mein se ek hissa hai.' Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Yahi kafi hoti. Aap ne farmaya: 'Use unhattar darje badha diya gaya hai.'"
"965","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Tumhari yeh aag jahannam ki aag ka sattarwan hissa hai. Agar us par saat martaba pani na dala gaya hota to insan us se faida nahin utha sakta tha.'"
"966","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Ham duniya mein aane mein sab se aakhir hain, lekin Qayamat ke din sab se pahle honge. Meri ummat mein se jannat mein dakhil hone wali pahli jama'at sattar hazaar afrad hongi jin ka koi hisab nahin hoga. Un mein se har ek ka chehra chaudhwin raat ke chaand ki manind chamkega. Phir jo un ke baad aayenge woh aasman ke sab se roshan sitare ki manind chamkenge, aur phir us ke baad woh darja ba darja, ek ke baad ek honge.'"
"967","[AI-translation] Ibn Abi Khalid ne isi sanad se wohi riwayat bayan ki."
"968","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Mujh par durood bhejo, kyunke tumhara mujh par durood bhejna tumhare liye pakeezgi ka zariya hai; aur Allah se mere liye Waseelah mango.' Rawi ne kaha: Aap se Waseelah ke bare mein poocha gaya, ya Aap ne unhen us ke bare mein bataya, aur farmaya: 'Woh jannat mein ek aala martaba hai; sirf ek shakhs use payega, aur mujhe ummeed hai ke main woh shakhs hunga.'"
"969","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Mujh par durood bhejo, kyunke woh tumhare liye pakeezgi hai; aur Allah se mere liye Waseelah mango, kyunke woh jannat mein ek aala martaba hai jise sirf ek aadmi payega, aur mujhe ummeed hai ke main woh aadmi hunga.'"
"970","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) dua mangte: 'Aey Allah! Main Tujh se bhook se panah mangta hun, kyunke woh bura saathi hai; aur Main Tujh se khiyanat se panah mangta hun, kyunke woh bura raazdar hai' — ya unhon ne kaha: buri nishani."
"971","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne poocha: 'Ya Rasulullah! Jannat kaisi banai gai hai?' Aap ne farmaya: 'Ek eent sone ki aur ek eent chaandi ki hai, us ka gara mushk hai, us ki mitti za'fran hai, us ke kankar moti hain. Jo us mein dakhil hoga khush hoga aur mayoos nahin hoga, us ka libas purana nahin hoga, na us ki jawani kam hogi.'"
"972","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke un se poocha gaya: Kya (mard) jannat ki auraton se jimak karenge? Unhon ne jawab diya: Han, aise aala ke sath jo kabhi thakega nahin, aise aala ke sath jo kabhi purana nahin hoga, aur aisi khwahish ke sath jo kabhi khatm nahin hogi."
"973","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha gaya: Kya Ahle Jannat apni biwiyon se jimak karenge? To Aap ne farmaya: 'Han, aise aala ke sath jo thakega nahin, aise aala ke sath jo purana nahin hoga, aur aisi khwahish ke sath jo khatm nahin hogi.'"
"974","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Aey Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam), mujhe batayen: Jannat jis ki chaudai aasmanon aur zameen ke barabar hai — to jahannam kahan hogi? To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Mujhe batao: yeh raat jis ne tumhare liye har cheez ko dhanp liya hai — us ka kya banega?' Us ne kaha: Allah behtar janta hai. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Allah jo chahta hai karta hai.'"
"975","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo jannat mein dakhil hoga woh Adam (Alaihissalam) ki surat mein hoga. (Adam Alaihissalam ke baad) logon ka qad ghat ta raha hai.'"
"976","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jannat napasandeeda cheezon se gheri hui hai, jabke jahannam khwahishat se gheri hui hai.'"
"977","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Woh donon aadmi jannat mein ikathe nahin ho sakte, jin mein se ek ne apne Musalman bhai se kaha: Aey kafir.'"
"978","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jannat mein ek darakht hai jis ke sae mein sawar sau saal safar karega, lekin us ka saya khatm nahin hoga.'"
"979","[AI-translation] Hasan (Rahimahullah) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai, aur Auf ne kaha: Mujhe bataya gaya hai ke woh (saya) phailaya jayega."
"980","[AI-translation] Is sanad se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Allah ki qasam! Jannat mein tum mein se kisi ki kaman ya kode ke barabar jagah aasmanon aur zameen ke darmiyan jo hai us se behtar hai.'"
"981","[AI-translation] Hamen Ghiyas bin Basheer ne, Abdullah bin Muslim bin Hurmuz Hurmuzi se, Mujahid se bayan kiya, jinhon ne kaha: Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se kaha gaya: 'Kya jannat mein sama'at hai?' Unhon ne kaha: 'Han, ek darakht jis ka tana sone ka aur us ki shakhen chaandi ki hain, aur us ka phal yaqoot aur zamurrad hain. Us par hawa bheji jati hai, to woh us ke baaz ko baaz se takrati hai, aur us se ziyada khubsurat kuch kabhi suna nahin gaya.'"
